WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
What does Learn leave to you?

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:04.650
It gives one request at
a time, written by hand.

3
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.109
It doesn't keep the definitions
where a reviewer approves them,

4
00:00:08.109 --> 00:00:11.501
check a definition against its
own limits before the request,

5
00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:15.825
decide between create and new version,
or measure what the workflows achieved.

6
00:00:15.825 --> 00:00:19.190
So the kit keeps one file
per workflow, lints it,

7
00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:24.325
plans create or new version, and counts
readiness, each pinned by a test.

8
00:00:24.325 --> 00:00:28.461
The verdict: keep Learn's bodies
exactly as Learn shapes them,

9
00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.080
and add the file, lint and plan in front.
